<title>FINLAND: PONSSE JAN-APRIL PROFIT FALLS 27 PERCENT.</title>
<headline>PONSSE JAN-APRIL PROFIT FALLS 27 PERCENT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four months to end-April,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items, tax    12.1 vs 16.6</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   1.92 vs 2.88</p>
<p> Net sales					  145.2 vs 128.0</p>
<p> Operating profit				  12.3 vs 16.7</p>
<p> Operating profit before depreciation	14.5 vs 18.6</p>
<p> Depreciation					 2.2 vs 1.9</p>
<p> Net financial items		     charge 0.2 vs 0.1 charge</p>
<p> Taxes						  5.5 vs 6.7</p>
<p> Net profit					   7.2 vs 10.4</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	    59.8 vs 58.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish forest harvester manufacturer is</p>
<p>Ponsse Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358 0 680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
